    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110246" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φᾰνερ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make manifest,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεαυτὸν τῷ κόσμῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Jo.</u>
					7.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
				5.10
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); <i>reveal, make clear,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ τὴν ἀλήθειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					925.4
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(v A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀληθῆ πεφανέρωται</span>”
				<i>have been demonstrated,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Olymp.
				</span></i>
			 Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.88
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make known</i> or <i>famous,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				10.37
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>become so,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφανερώθη ἐς τοὺς Ἕλληνας δαπάνῃσι
					μεγίστῃσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.122
				</span></i>
			.</div>
